  data: {
    LLM: "Three rounds of buying, each followed by betting. Buying round: players in turn choose to (1) Buy a card - discard one and buy a replacement (pay price to pot), (2) Stand pat, or (3) Fold. Face-up cards bought are replaced immediately (except last player's purchase). Face-down deck cards stay face down. Betting rounds begin with player showing best hand. After third betting round, surviving players declare high/low/both then showdown.",
    Player: "Three rounds of buying, each followed by betting. Buying round: players in turn choose to (1) Buy a card - discard one and buy a replacement (pay price to pot), (2) Stand pat, or (3) Fold. Face-up cards bought are replaced immediately (except last player's purchase). Face-down deck cards stay face down. Betting rounds begin with player showing best hand. After third betting round, surviving players declare high/low/both then showdown.",
    objective: 'Form the best 5-card high hand, low hand, or both (declaration). Win the pot by having the best hand at showdown or by making others fold.',
    gameplay: "Three rounds of buying, each followed by betting. Buying round: players in turn choose to (1) Buy a card - discard one and buy a replacement (pay price to pot), (2) Stand pat, or (3) Fold. Face-up cards bought are replaced immediately (except last player's purchase). Face-down deck cards stay face down. Betting rounds begin with player showing best hand. After third betting round, surviving players declare high/low/both then showdown.",
    keyRules: [
      '5 cards each: 2 down, 3 up',
      'Buy prices: 1, 2, 3, 4 units (unit = ante/minimum bet)',
      '3 buying rounds, each followed by betting',
      'Must maintain at least 2 hole cards',
      'Face-up cards replaced when bought; deck cards stay face down',
      'High-low with declaration after final betting',
      'Best hand showing starts betting rounds',
