    },
    turnFlow: "Three rounds of buying, each followed by betting. Buying round: players in turn choose to (1) Buy a card - discard one and buy a replacement (pay price to pot), (2) Stand pat, or (3) Fold. Face-up cards bought are replaced immediately (except last player's purchase). Face-down deck cards stay face down. Betting rounds begin with player showing best hand. After third betting round, surviving players declare high/low/both then showdown.",
